# Ledger overlays

- Action menus must portal to `document.body`. Never rely on in-cell popups inside `overflow-x-auto`.
- Do not size menu popups with `w-(--anchor-width)` for icon triggers — use `w-max min-w-44`.
- Long titles truncate with `max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-[300px] truncate`. Full text lives in a Tooltip/`title`.
- Tax column stays a compact Badge. Amounts belong in a hover tooltip, not extra row height.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — clipped by the table scroller, 32px wide
<DropdownMenuContent className="w-(--anchor-width)" />

// ✅ GOOD
<DropdownMenuPortal>
  <DropdownMenuContent className="z-[200] w-max min-w-44" />
</DropdownMenuPortal>
```
